<title>USA: Alarmguard acquires alarm company.</title>
<headline>Alarmguard acquires alarm company.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Conn. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alarmguard Holdings Inc said it has completed the acquisition of Telcoa International Corp for about $4.2 million in cash and stock.</p>
<p>Telcoa has about 2,300 alarm subscribers in the Fairfield County section of Connecticut and in the metropolitan New York area, generating monthly revenues of about $125,000, Alarmguard said.</p>
<p>The purchase price consists of $1.6 million in cash that is to be paid at the closing and about 379,000 shares of Alarmguard common stock.</p>
<p>Alarmguard is a provider of electronic security systems.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
